(6352862, 940401, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice to see something a bit different yet still fall well within the challenge. Where many have made up a person or create a character to look like someone Librodo would shoot (myself included), you shot a person who was already there. I don''t get any feeling that this person is not who you are portraying them to be. I voted the first time around on my laptop (which was a mistake) but going through now and taking a bit more time gets you a bump up of 2 and in my top 5 for the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice to see something a bit different yet still fall well within the challenge. Where many have made up a person or create a character to look like someone Librodo would shoot (myself included), you shot a person who was already there. I don''t get any feeling that this person is not who you are portraying them to be. I voted the first time around on my laptop (which was a mistake) but going through now and taking a bit more time gets you a bump up of 2 and in my top 5 for the challenge.', '2011-03-16 06:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
