(6353682, 939911, 74911, '<td valign="top">I agree that the use of model, burst of colors, composition, lighting and post-processing results (to some extent) are close to Librodo''s style.<br/> <br/>I would have tried to achieve some sharpness on the eye lashes, eye brows, lips etc. It looks a lot plastic-like effect on the face.</td>', 'I agree that the use of model, burst of colors, composition, lighting and post-processing results (to some extent) are close to Librodo''s style. I would have tried to achieve some sharpness on the eye lashes, eye brows, lips etc. It looks a lot plastic-like effect on the face.', '2011-03-16 19:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353683, 940161, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good use of colors... great composition, nice expressions, good processing and a suitable title too. This should do well.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Good use of colors... great composition, nice expressions, good processing and a suitable title too. This should do well. Raj', '2011-03-16 19:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353686, 940191, 74911, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of colors, great level of details on the face, good use of tilt, great make-up work on the model. This should do well.<br/> <br/>I do not know if you had planned for this - I see a burst of colors in the background and the colors on the model are totally opposite to the background. The use of colors on her lips, her clothes, hair color and skin tone are all subtle colors. Great results.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Brilliant use of colors, great level of details on the face, good use of tilt, great make-up work on the model. This should do well. I do not know if you had planned for this - I see a burst of colors in the background and the colors on the model are totally opposite to the background. The use of colors on her lips, her clothes, hair color and skin tone are all subtle colors. Great results. Raj', '2011-03-16 19:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353687, 940401, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and great contrast. I guess you have tried to Manny''s Rosalinda image. Excuse me, if that is not the case. But overall great image.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Nice textures and great contrast. I guess you have tried to Manny''s Rosalinda image. Excuse me, if that is not the case. But overall great image. Raj', '2011-03-16 19:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353690, 940679, 74911, '<td valign="top">Everything works in this image - the high contrast, B&amp;W, shallow depth of field, those deep and expressive eyes. I would like to see some more focus on the eyes and finger nails.</td>', 'Everything works in this image - the high contrast, B&W, shallow depth of field, those deep and expressive eyes. I would like to see some more focus on the eyes and finger nails.', '2011-03-16 19:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353692, 940496, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good use of colors.</td>', 'Good use of colors.', '2011-03-16 19:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353693, 940866, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good composition and great expression. But too soft, IMO.</td>', 'Nice colors, good composition and great expression. But too soft, IMO.', '2011-03-16 19:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353694, 940625, 74911, '<td valign="top">Certainly a great attempt and good results. I feel the eyes and lips are oversharpened. And compositionally, I feel that the left part of her face could have been included. It feels to me that something is missing that side. It may just be me. <br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Certainly a great attempt and good results. I feel the eyes and lips are oversharpened. And compositionally, I feel that the left part of her face could have been included. It feels to me that something is missing that side. It may just be me.  Raj', '2011-03-16 19:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353696, 940922, 74911, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I like the simple use of colors and a good post-processing. Eyes are really appealing. The highlight on the forehead is a bit bothering to me.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Beautiful image. I like the simple use of colors and a good post-processing. Eyes are really appealing. The highlight on the forehead is a bit bothering to me. Raj', '2011-03-16 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353697, 940859, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good colors, composition, use of light and processing.</td>', 'Good colors, composition, use of light and processing.', '2011-03-16 19:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353698, 940944, 74911, '<td valign="top">While I like this image after staring at it for few seconds, I feel that it the background steals the attention more than the model''s face.</td>', 'While I like this image after staring at it for few seconds, I feel that it the background steals the attention more than the model''s face.', '2011-03-16 19:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353699, 940629, 74911, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant!</td>', 'Simple and elegant!', '2011-03-16 19:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353704, 940778, 74911, '<td valign="top">Effect on eyes look great. His expression, body art and the overall effect due to processing are good.<br/> <br/>There is a slight halo in the background where the veil ends and background starts. And also his skin (on either side of his nose) looks a lot unnatural. On my monitor, it looks almost like made out of some kinda flour (for some reason).<br/> <br/>I would say you have made a great conceptual portait with Joey L. At the same time, I feel this could have been top-notch with that kinda opportunity to shoot Joey.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Effect on eyes look great. His expression, body art and the overall effect due to processing are good. There is a slight halo in the background where the veil ends and background starts. And also his skin (on either side of his nose) looks a lot unnatural. On my monitor, it looks almost like made out of some kinda flour (for some reason). I would say you have made a great conceptual portait with Joey L. At the same time, I feel this could have been top-notch with that kinda opportunity to shoot Joey. Raj', '2011-03-16 19:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353706, 940320, 74911, '<td valign="top">As such this image is great in terms of lighting, processing and effect. If you have not entered this image in this challenge, I doubt if someone would look at it and say this looks like Librodo''s style.</td>', 'As such this image is great in terms of lighting, processing and effect. If you have not entered this image in this challenge, I doubt if someone would look at it and say this looks like Librodo''s style.', '2011-03-16 19:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353708, 940353, 74911, '<td valign="top">Amazing use of light. Great image, I should say.</td>', 'Amazing use of light. Great image, I should say.', '2011-03-16 19:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353709, 940888, 74911, '<td valign="top">Yes, this image certainly reminds me of one of Librodo''s brilliant captures. Great results.</td>', 'Yes, this image certainly reminds me of one of Librodo''s brilliant captures. Great results.', '2011-03-16 19:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353711, 940363, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, expressions and composition. The lighting looks like it is from a softbox (based on what I see on her pupils). I do not know if natural light would have been a better choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Great lighting, expressions and composition. The lighting looks like it is from a softbox (based on what I see on her pupils). I do not know if natural light would have been a better choice for this challenge.', '2011-03-16 19:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353757, 940859, 121949, '<td valign="top">For sure the winner of this challenge, excellent work.</td>', 'For sure the winner of this challenge, excellent work.', '2011-03-16 20:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353759, 940161, 121949, '<td valign="top">I love the blending of your <u><b>too</b></u> styles. Excellent take on this challenge, I''m sure you are doing well, got a 9 from me.</td>', 'I love the blending of your too styles. Excellent take on this challenge, I''m sure you are doing well, got a 9 from me.', '2011-03-16 20:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
