(6354176, 940655, 96751, '<td valign="top">This image lacks subtlety for me.  Very bold and jarring colors, although the model''s eyes are beautiful.</td>', 'This image lacks subtlety for me.  Very bold and jarring colors, although the model''s eyes are beautiful.', '2011-03-17 02:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
