(6354180, 940895, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Very lovely, although the eyes really need a bit more pop.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Very lovely, although the eyes really need a bit more pop.', '2011-03-17 02:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354182, 940964, 96751, '<td valign="top">Second male other than my own.  Awesome shot.  You nailed the eye.<br/> <br/>As I write this, it occurs to me that the image MIGHT be Manny''s, in which case you would HAVE to nail the eye.  Of course, it''s not necessarily Manny''s image, in which case... never mind.  Carry on.</td>', 'Second male other than my own.  Awesome shot.  You nailed the eye. As I write this, it occurs to me that the image MIGHT be Manny''s, in which case you would HAVE to nail the eye.  Of course, it''s not necessarily Manny''s image, in which case... never mind.  Carry on.', '2011-03-17 02:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
