(6354209, 940161, 69325, '<td valign="top">ETA<br/>I keep coming back to this shot, I don''t know why but i feel bad about my comment and I keep wanting to word it correctly so as not to hurt anyone. I like it overall, there is just sometihg in the overly smooth skin and eyes that almost take this into the realm of digital art. not that i dont like the shot itself but i dont like it for this challenge, if that makes sense.<br/>I think you are aware of this as i think your title is a bit tongue-in-cheek. i am pretty sure at this point this is Tim''s shot so i am thinking you prob got thick enough skin to take my comment...lol ok i am going to stop being obsessive now :) at any rate a solid 7 from me</td>', 'ETAI keep coming back to this shot, I don''t know why but i feel bad about my comment and I keep wanting to word it correctly so as not to hurt anyone. I like it overall, there is just sometihg in the overly smooth skin and eyes that almost take this into the realm of digital art. not that i dont like the shot itself but i dont like it for this challenge, if that makes sense.I think you are aware of this as i think your title is a bit tongue-in-cheek. i am pretty sure at this point this is Tim''s shot so i am thinking you prob got thick enough skin to take my comment...lol ok i am going to stop being obsessive now :) at any rate a solid 7 from me', '2011-03-17 03:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
