(6354653, 940655, 54645, '<td valign="top">First, I like the intense gaze of your lovely model. I gave this a 5, impart because I''m not feeling anything from the portrait, it''s just a portrait; IMO, this is due primarily to the lighting and background. <br/> <br/>The lighting gurus will likely tell you that you have some hot spots on the face and neck, and that you did not achieve the Rembrandt style lighting voters were likely expecting. The background is interesting, looks like a giant leaf, but, IMO, it is much to bright and is visually very prominent.</td>', 'First, I like the intense gaze of your lovely model. I gave this a 5, impart because I''m not feeling anything from the portrait, it''s just a portrait; IMO, this is due primarily to the lighting and background.  The lighting gurus will likely tell you that you have some hot spots on the face and neck, and that you did not achieve the Rembrandt style lighting voters were likely expecting. The background is interesting, looks like a giant leaf, but, IMO, it is much to bright and is visually very prominent.', '2011-03-17 13:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354655, 940578, 113419, '<td valign="top">There is something about this photo I love but I can''t quite put my finger on it.  I''m wondering though if your getting beat up cause she''s wearing sunglasses?  Not sure that''s Manny''s style, but still I love this and that may be why, because I can''t see the eyes, all the emotion seems to be hidden and using the arm with bracelets as a type of veil is genius.</td>', 'There is something about this photo I love but I can''t quite put my finger on it.  I''m wondering though if your getting beat up cause she''s wearing sunglasses?  Not sure that''s Manny''s style, but still I love this and that may be why, because I can''t see the eyes, all the emotion seems to be hidden and using the arm with bracelets as a type of veil is genius.', '2011-03-17 13:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354656, 939860, 39427, '<td valign="top">I love it, Mak!</td>', 'I love it, Mak!', '2011-03-17 13:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
