(6355684, 940235, 114233, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Ben. You have captured a special facial expression here. The composition is really nice and you are forced to look straight at her eyes. The DOF is very narrow though and I would have preferred it a bit deeper - her nose and chin are soft and looks a little out of place against the textured and aged skin on the cheeks. Not sure what happened between the right (as wee look at it) eye and the hair / ear - there is a very abrupt change from in focus to OOF.<br/>Overall a nice shot and I hope you do well.</td>', 'Nice shot Ben. You have captured a special facial expression here. The composition is really nice and you are forced to look straight at her eyes. The DOF is very narrow though and I would have preferred it a bit deeper - her nose and chin are soft and looks a little out of place against the textured and aged skin on the cheeks. Not sure what happened between the right (as wee look at it) eye and the hair / ear - there is a very abrupt change from in focus to OOF.Overall a nice shot and I hope you do well.', '2011-03-18 03:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
