(6359854, 940403, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is a gem, Librodo or not. A child waiting for life to happen, old enough to have some memories, innocent enough to have the wildest expectancies. More deeply felt than some of Librodo scarfed figures. Top 5 <br/>(I just wished for a bit more definition of the wall just behind the boy - and that''s to be very fussy!) Bravo.</td>', 'This is a gem, Librodo or not. A child waiting for life to happen, old enough to have some memories, innocent enough to have the wildest expectancies. More deeply felt than some of Librodo scarfed figures. Top 5 (I just wished for a bit more definition of the wall just behind the boy - and that''s to be very fussy!) Bravo.', '2011-03-22 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6359855, 940742, 124815, '<td valign="top">My island was now peopled, and I thought myself very rich in subjects; and it was a merry reflection, which I frequently made, how like a king I looked..."<br/>Robinson Crusoe.<br/>Splendid</td>', 'My island was now peopled, and I thought myself very rich in subjects; and it was a merry reflection, which I frequently made, how like a king I looked..."Robinson Crusoe.Splendid', '2011-03-22 10:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6359856, 940453, 124815, '<td valign="top">Captivating. Very good composition. I wonder if you tried with a different color for the background. Grayish magenta or the deep burgundy that shows through through the fan.</td>', 'Captivating. Very good composition. I wonder if you tried with a different color for the background. Grayish magenta or the deep burgundy that shows through through the fan.', '2011-03-22 10:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
