(6360675, 940625, 66641, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone!  I admit, everything I learned about editing, I learned starting with this photo, so hopefully I can only get better from here.  The model is me, so getting the focus right was a challenge.  But I''m happy with my finish.  :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone!  I admit, everything I learned about editing, I learned starting with this photo, so hopefully I can only get better from here.  The model is me, so getting the focus right was a challenge.  But I''m happy with my finish.  :)', '2011-03-23 00:39:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360678, 940778, 96751, '<td valign="top">You indeed entered something quite different.  Fabulous image.  I should have know it was yours from the eyes alone.  This is the first time I''ve ever seen a picture of Joey, so that wouldn''t have helped :-)</td>', 'You indeed entered something quite different.  Fabulous image.  I should have know it was yours from the eyes alone.  This is the first time I''ve ever seen a picture of Joey, so that wouldn''t have helped :-)', '2011-03-23 00:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
