(6360794, 940778, 58785, '<td valign="top"><b>yes, the famous Joey L.</b> <br/> <br/>This is a great shot. Sadly, I think new DPCers don''t know him well... It''s sad he is not entering any challenges, and very very sad never took his photo with my hat I sent ;)<br/> <br/>He''s been grown to a man (from a boy)... and what''s with the tattoo? I didn''t know he had one, or I wasn''t paying attention to i t.<br/> <br/>Two masters, one photo... and I am honored to follow this one as 40th place :)<br/> <br/>Leo</td>', 'yes, the famous Joey L.  This is a great shot. Sadly, I think new DPCers don''t know him well... It''s sad he is not entering any challenges, and very very sad never took his photo with my hat I sent ;) He''s been grown to a man (from a boy)... and what''s with the tattoo? I didn''t know he had one, or I wasn''t paying attention to i t. Two masters, one photo... and I am honored to follow this one as 40th place :) Leo', '2011-03-23 01:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
