(6405492, 940922, 14386, '<td valign="top">Neil, I gave this a 7.<br/> <br/>I actually like this.  My only suggestion to further improve this is the lighting.  It is a bit flat but with photoshop, it can look more 3 dimensional.  Maybe some darkness in the edges.  Or a vignette will do.<br/> <br/>Alsoi don''t really like that it is quite obvious that someone is holding up the veil .  Maybe have it falling naturally would look it more spontaneous.</td>', 'Neil, I gave this a 7. I actually like this.  My only suggestion to further improve this is the lighting.  It is a bit flat but with photoshop, it can look more 3 dimensional.  Maybe some darkness in the edges.  Or a vignette will do. Alsoi don''t really like that it is quite obvious that someone is holding up the veil .  Maybe have it falling naturally would look it more spontaneous.', '2011-05-06 03:37:59.000000', NULL, 0),
